    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for mokutil",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for mokutil fixes the following issues:\n\n- Adds SBAT revocation support to mokutil. (bsc#1198458)\n\nNew options added (see manpage):\n\n- mokutil --set-sbat-policy  (latest | previous | delete)\n  to set the SBAT acceptance policy.\n\n- mokutil --list-sbat-revocations\n\n  To list the current SBAT revocations.\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
